        "id": 1960535
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T11:58:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to indicate connection failure, therefore sending BT_STATUS_FAIL and BT_ACL_STATE_CONNECTED.\nWe could also send BT_ACL_STATE_DISCONNECTED, but that risks confusing this situation with a disconnection failure. \n\nHowever, currently it is impossible to send BT_STATUS_FAIL and BT_ACL_STATE_DISCONNECTED, because apparently libbluetooth doesn\u0027t check the status on disconnection - it just clean up the connection. I think that is incorrect though, but perhaps is not trivial to fix.\n\nWDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "d1b8cec9_1ad31574",
